# CLAUDE.md — subzero-rs (SECURITY-CRITICAL)

> Drop this file at the root of `subzero-rs` to pull in the subfrost-ops domain pack.

**Layer**: foundational. This repo publishes the signing protocol consumed by cross-chain bridge flows in **subfrost-app** and **subfrost-mobile**. Signing-protocol or PSBT-format changes can break bridge UX without breaking either repo's build. For non-trivial changes, run the `stack-preflight` agent. See `docs/LAYER-MODEL.md`.

Threshold signing OS for Bitcoin. FROST + ROAST + frtun (quantum-safe overlay network). Bridge signer programs for Bitcoin, Ethereum, Zcash.

## Cardinal rule
This codebase signs joint transactions on behalf of real funds. A subtle bug here = key loss, forgery, or signing-set denial of service. Crypto-engineer rigor; assume every change can break consensus among the signing set.

