## Known gaps (audit-flagged)
- `crates/subzero-keystore/src/lib.rs:88-92` — PBKDF2-derived key not zeroized (bare array)
- Signing nonces missing explicit `Drop` zeroization
- No exponential backoff or peer-liveness detection on DKG hard timeouts

